{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sequelize/sequelize/pulls/8430","id":144822165,"node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0MTQ0ODIyMTY1","html_url":"https://github.com/sequelize/sequelize/pull/8430","diff_url":"https://github.com/sequelize/sequelize/pull/8430.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/sequelize/sequelize/pull/8430.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sequelize/sequelize/issues/8430","number":8430,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(transactions): don't set transaction on continuation storage when…","user":{"login":"tylerjwatson","id":5001408,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDE0MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5001408?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tylerjwatson","html_url":"https://github.com/tylerjwatson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tylerjwatson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tylerjwatson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tylerjwatson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tylerjwatson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tylerjwatson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tylerjwatson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tylerjwatson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tylerjwatson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tylerjwatson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"… manually managed\r\n\r\n<!-- \r\nThanks for wanting to fix something on Sequelize - we already love you long time!\r\nPlease fill in the template below.\r\nIf unsure about something, just do as best as you're able.\r\n\r\nIf your PR only contains changes to documentation, you may skip the template below.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n### Pull Request check-list\r\n\r\n_Please make sure to review and check all of these items:_\r\n\r\n- [X] Does `npm run test` or `npm run test-DIALECT` pass with this change (including linting)?\r\n- [X] Does the description below contain a link to an existing issue (Closes #[issue]) or a description of the issue you are solving?\r\n- [X] Have you added new tests to prevent regressions?\r\n- [ ] Is a documentation update included (if this change modifies existing APIs, or introduces new ones)?\r\n- [X] Did you follow the commit message conventions explained in CONTRIBUTING.md?\r\n\r\n<!-- NOTE: these things are not required to open a PR and can be done afterwards / while the PR is open. -->\r\n\r\n### Description of change\r\n\r\nThis patch prevents Sequelize from adding a transaction to the continuation storage namespace when the transaction is manually managed.  Traditionally `Transaction#prepareEnvironment` would unconditionally set the transaction on the continuation storage, but is sunk immediately because manual transactions are never run under `Sequelize._clsRun`.  \r\n\r\nHas associated test.  Closes #8429.","created_at":"2017-10-05T03:31:38Z","updated_at":"2017-10-31T07:32:20Z","closed_at":"2017-10-09T16:31:22Z","merged_at":"2017-10-09T16:31:22Z","merge_commit_sha":"e2dad2f94308fb152f821a0eada2ba3719d53584","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sequelize/sequelize/pulls/8430/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sequelize/sequelize/pulls/8430/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sequelize/sequelize/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sequelize/sequelize/issues/8430/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sequelize/sequelize/statuses/a2d0c10a38083958361ff8218a015adcc21e7764","head":{"label":"tylerjwatson:cls-on-manual-transactions","ref":"cls-on-manual-transactions","sha":"a2d0c10a38083958361ff8218a015adcc21e7764","user":{"login":"tylerjwatson","id":5001408,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDE0MDg=","avatar_url":"ht